> **Status:** Backend implementation and initial API testing are complete. The frontend and final submission deliverables are still being completed by the team. Update the marked sections before final submission.

## 1. Project Overview

GigTask is a gig-work platform that uses PostgreSQL for relational data and transactional workflows, and MongoDB for worker locations, reviews, and portfolio documents. Assignment 1B extends the existing Part A project with a backend API and a web frontend.

